  "落笔": {
    "行": [
      "$x+2y=3-xy$。",
      "$x>0$、$2y>0$，所以 $x+2y\\ge2\\sqrt{2xy}$。",
      "因此 $3-xy\\ge2\\sqrt{2xy}$。",
      "令 $u=\\sqrt{xy}>0$。",
      "$3-u^2\\ge2\\sqrt2\\,u$，所以 $u^2+2\\sqrt2\\,u\\le3$。",
      "两边加 $2$，得 $(u+\\sqrt2)^2\\le5$。",
      "$u+\\sqrt2>0$，所以 $u+\\sqrt2\\le\\sqrt5$。",
      "所以 $0<u\\le\\sqrt5-\\sqrt2$。",
      "因此 $xy=u^2\\le(\\sqrt5-\\sqrt2)^2=7-2\\sqrt{10}$。",
      "相等需要 $x=2y$。",
      "代回 $x+2y+xy=3$，得 $4y+2y^2=3$。",
      "所以 $(y+1)^2=\\dfrac52$。",
      "$y>0$，所以 $y=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{10}-2}2$、$x=\\sqrt{10}-2$。",
      "两者均正，且 $xy=7-2\\sqrt{10}$。",
      "所以最大值为 $7-2\\sqrt{10}$。",
      "当且仅当满足下列取等条件时，所用的界成为最值：$x=2y$，得 $x=\\sqrt{10}-2,y=(\\sqrt{10}-2)/2$。",
      "$x+2y=2\\sqrt{10}-4$，$xy=7-2\\sqrt{10}$，相加恰为 $3$。"
    ],
